{#- Luna's book from earlier games (pass 4 L). Shown before the rulebook, in the
    cached part of the prompt: it changes only with the phase, the ante and the
    ante's boss, and between games when a game's edits are merged. -#}
# YOUR BOOK (rules you wrote after earlier games)
{%- if not top and not rules and not summaries %}
Your book is empty: this is your first game with it. After the game you will write your first rules.
{%- else %}
These are your own rules, written after earlier games. Use them when they fit; the STATUS facts and the rules below still come first when they disagree.
{%- if top %}

## Top rules (always shown)
{% for r in top -%}
{{ rule_line(r) }}
{% endfor %}
{%- endif %}
{%- if rules %}

## Rules for this situation ({{ phase }}, Ante {{ ante }}{% if boss %}, boss {{ boss }}{% endif %})
{% for r in rules -%}
{{ rule_line(r) }}
{% endfor %}
{%- endif %}
{%- if summaries %}

## Recent games (oldest first)
{% for s in summaries -%}
- {{ s.text }}
{% endfor %}
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
